WEBVTT

00:07:59.475 --> 00:08:02.061
Every men's sports story imaginable.

00:08:02.061 --> 00:08:03.896
(Laughter)

00:08:06.106 --> 00:08:09.944
The reality is that just existing
in our culture,

00:08:09.985 --> 00:08:11.946
you will know a dozen men’s storylines.

00:08:12.446 --> 00:08:15.908
I mean, these things are literally
push-notified to your phone.

00:08:17.159 --> 00:08:19.578
Or you're sitting behind someone
on an airplane,

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.748
and you can’t help but see
what they’re watching on ESPN.

00:08:22.748 --> 00:08:26.460
Or you’re at a bar, or a doctor’s office,

00:08:26.502 --> 00:08:29.838
and the talking heads are giving you
the latest NBA drama.